WEBVTT

00:00:06.101 --> 00:00:07.502
All right.
好了 接近目标了

00:00:07.535 --> 00:00:09.337
We're getting close.
好了 接近目标了

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.406
From now on,
every move must be made
从现在起

00:00:11.439 --> 00:00:14.075
with total precision
and purpose.
我们每走一步都得千般小心万般谨慎

00:00:14.109 --> 00:00:15.711
(giggles)

00:00:15.744 --> 00:00:16.712
Gum.
-泡泡糖
-专心点

00:00:16.745 --> 00:00:18.279
Focus!
-泡泡糖
-专心点

00:00:18.313 --> 00:00:20.716
We're after the diamond,
not the bubble gum.
我们找的是钻石 不是泡泡糖

00:00:20.749 --> 00:00:22.651
Got it!
明白了

00:00:24.953 --> 00:00:26.888
Mmm, yum.
好吃

00:00:28.123 --> 00:00:30.058
This way.
这边

00:00:30.091 --> 00:00:34.395
And, now,
to put this where it belongs.
现在把钻石放在该待的地方

00:00:34.429 --> 00:00:35.563
Wha...

00:00:35.597 --> 00:00:37.065
Look at it, Clive.
瞧瞧吧 克里夫 是不是很壮观

00:00:37.098 --> 00:00:39.100
It's beautiful!
瞧瞧吧 克里夫 是不是很壮观

00:00:41.903 --> 00:00:44.239
(desperate grunting)

00:00:44.272 --> 00:00:47.275
Will you please shut up?
He's gonna spot us.
你给我闭嘴好吗？他会发现我们的

00:00:47.308 --> 00:00:49.244
(grunting, gasping)

00:00:49.277 --> 00:00:51.079
(gasps)
Spit it out! Spit it out!
吐出来 我说过不要碰任何东西

00:00:51.112 --> 00:00:52.814
I told you
not to touch anything!
吐出来 我说过不要碰任何东西

00:00:52.848 --> 00:00:54.650
(gagging)

00:00:54.683 --> 00:00:56.051
(grunting)

00:00:56.084 --> 00:00:58.253
Intruders! Intruders!
有人闯入

00:00:58.286 --> 00:00:59.487
Intruders!
有人闯入

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.489
(grunting)

00:01:01.522 --> 00:01:04.059
Freeze, dipsticks!
不许动 两个笨蛋

00:01:04.092 --> 00:01:06.227
Gru? There's two of you now?
格鲁 怎么有两个你？

00:01:06.261 --> 00:01:08.429
Then this will be twice
as much fun!
看来能享受双倍的乐趣了

00:01:08.463 --> 00:01:10.999
(laughing)
看来能享受双倍的乐趣了

00:01:11.032 --> 00:01:12.067
(grunts)

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.635
(shouts)

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:15.804
(laughing)

00:01:15.837 --> 00:01:18.239
(gasps)
Give me back my diamond!
把我的钻石还给我

00:01:18.273 --> 00:01:20.408
-Total lockdown!
-(gasps) -(alarm wailing)
关闭所有出口

00:01:20.441 --> 00:01:22.110
Go get 'em, Bratt Pack!
抓住他们 坏小子们

00:01:23.178 --> 00:01:25.847
(dolls laughing)

00:01:25.881 --> 00:01:28.149
(whimpers)

00:01:28.183 --> 00:01:29.951
(shouts)

00:01:29.985 --> 00:01:31.787
(whimpers)
They're gonna get us!
要抓住我们了

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:33.088
They're gonna get us!
要抓住我们了

00:01:33.121 --> 00:01:34.322
(dolls laughing)

00:01:34.355 --> 00:01:35.991
-Run!
-(shouts)
跑

00:01:36.024 --> 00:01:37.926
(yelps)
跑

00:01:37.959 --> 00:01:39.661
(shouts)

00:01:39.695 --> 00:01:43.098
(gasping)

00:01:43.131 --> 00:01:45.500
(screams)

00:01:45.533 --> 00:01:47.468
(grunting)

00:01:47.502 --> 00:01:49.104
-Oh, no!
-(grunting)
不 现在是什么情况？

00:01:49.137 --> 00:01:51.039
What does that mean?
不 现在是什么情况？

00:01:51.072 --> 00:01:53.541
Are we gonna die?
Are we gonna die?!
我们要死了

00:01:53.574 --> 00:01:55.643
-We're gonna die! (screaming)
-Dru!

00:01:55.677 --> 00:01:57.478
(both shouting)

00:01:57.512 --> 00:01:59.748
(Dru screaming)

00:02:03.551 --> 00:02:04.953
(grunting)

00:02:04.986 --> 00:02:06.654
What?
什么？

00:02:06.688 --> 00:02:08.990
Hey, guys! Hold on!
-伙计们 撑住
-露西

00:02:09.024 --> 00:02:11.559
-Lucy!
-(yelps)
-伙计们 撑住
-露西

00:02:11.592 --> 00:02:14.696
(Dru warbling)

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:17.332
(Gru and Dru panting)

00:02:17.365 --> 00:02:19.334
Thank you for saving us!
谢谢你救了我们的命

00:02:19.367 --> 00:02:20.902
(sighs)
Look!
看呀 我们拿到钻石了

00:02:20.936 --> 00:02:23.138
We got the diamond,
and we're going to...
看呀 我们拿到钻石了

00:02:23.171 --> 00:02:26.041
Take it to the AVL
and get our jobs back!
带着它回到反恶人联盟把工作弄回来

00:02:26.074 --> 00:02:27.675
-(chuckles)
-Wait...
-慢着
-什么？那就太好了

00:02:27.709 --> 00:02:29.244
What? Oh, that's amazing!
-慢着
-什么？那就太好了

00:02:29.277 --> 00:02:31.179
And the best part is,
you'll never,
最重要的是你再也不要
背着我偷偷行动

00:02:31.212 --> 00:02:33.514
-ever go behind my back
-(cracking) -(groans, chuckles)
最重要的是你再也不要
背着我偷偷行动

00:02:33.548 --> 00:02:36.017
-ever again.
-(groaning)
-再也不要 懂了吗？
-亲爱的 懂了

00:02:36.051 --> 00:02:37.685
-Right, honey bear?
-Yeah.
-再也不要 懂了吗？
-亲爱的 懂了

00:02:37.719 --> 00:02:39.020
Yeah, right.
-再也不要 懂了吗？
-亲爱的 懂了

00:02:39.054 --> 00:02:40.889
Lesson learned.
得到教训了

00:02:53.268 --> 00:02:55.403
I'll get the girls
and start packing
我去叫女儿们 然后打包

00:02:55.436 --> 00:02:57.005
and tell 'em the good news!
Ah...
宣布这个好消息

00:02:57.038 --> 00:02:58.907
* We're getting our jobs back,
yeah. *
我们的工作回来了

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:01.910
Yes, yes! Go tell the girls.
对 去告诉女儿们

00:03:01.943 --> 00:03:03.178
Dru...
-德鲁
-不 没门

00:03:03.211 --> 00:03:04.245
No! No way!
-德鲁
-不 没门

00:03:04.279 --> 00:03:05.680
We can't give the diamond back!
我们不能把钻石还回去

00:03:05.713 --> 00:03:07.515
(grunts)
I have to.
-我必须还
-不 你不用

00:03:07.548 --> 00:03:08.850
No, you don't!
-我必须还
-不 你不用

00:03:08.884 --> 00:03:10.518
-Yes, I do.
-Give it!
-我必须还
-给我

00:03:10.551 --> 00:03:11.452
(grunts)
No!
-我必须还
-给我

00:03:11.486 --> 00:03:12.954
-Give it! (grunts)
-Ow!
-不
-给我

00:03:12.988 --> 00:03:14.555
What is wrong with you?
-你是不是有毛病？
-你是不是有毛病？

00:03:14.589 --> 00:03:15.723
What is wrong with you?!
-你是不是有毛病？
-你是不是有毛病？

00:03:15.757 --> 00:03:16.724
You kicked me!
-你踢我
-你骗我

00:03:16.758 --> 00:03:18.059
You-you lied to me!
-你踢我
-你骗我

00:03:18.093 --> 00:03:19.895
Hey, I would have told you
the truth.
我也想告诉你真相的

00:03:19.928 --> 00:03:22.730
But you're too much of a wimp
to handle it!
但你就是个胆小鬼 根本受不了

00:03:22.764 --> 00:03:24.299
That's it. I'm out of here.
就这样 我要离开这里

00:03:24.332 --> 00:03:26.234
You have no right to take that!
你没有权利把它带走
我们俩一起偷的

00:03:26.267 --> 00:03:27.568
We stole it together!
你没有权利把它带走
我们俩一起偷的

00:03:27.602 --> 00:03:29.304
Together?
(cackles)
一起偷的？开什么国际玩笑

00:03:29.337 --> 00:03:30.939
You got to be kidding me.
一起偷的？开什么国际玩笑

00:03:30.972 --> 00:03:32.874
You did nothing
but screw up the whole time.
你除了给我惹麻烦 什么也没做

00:03:32.908 --> 00:03:34.642
I got this in spite of you.
就这样我还拿到了

00:03:34.675 --> 00:03:38.479
Oh, yeah? Well, at least
I didn't get fired from my job
是吗？好吧
至少我没有像个失败者那样

00:03:38.513 --> 00:03:40.315
like a total loser!
被老板开除丢掉工作

00:03:40.348 --> 00:03:41.817
At least I had a job!
至少我还有份工作

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:43.919
What have you accomplished
that was so great?
而你又做了什么值得骄傲的事？

00:03:43.952 --> 00:03:45.320
I'll tell you what!
让我告诉你吧 没有

00:03:45.353 --> 00:03:47.322
Nothing!
让我告诉你吧 没有

00:03:47.355 --> 00:03:50.458
No wonder Dad thought
you were such a failure.
难怪爸爸会认为你是个失败者

00:03:50.491 --> 00:03:52.460
(gasps)
Uh...

00:03:52.493 --> 00:03:54.562
We are no longer brothers!
-我们再也不是兄弟了
-我不稀罕

00:03:54.595 --> 00:03:56.497
That's fine with me!
-我们再也不是兄弟了
-我不稀罕

00:03:58.333 --> 00:04:00.268
(frustrated grunt)

00:04:02.003 --> 00:04:05.406
(strumming ukulele gently)

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:08.343
(singing "99 Bottles of Beer"
listlessly in Minionese)

00:04:13.148 --> 00:04:15.050
(all singing along)

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:24.826
(singing "99 Bottles of Beer"
excitedly in Minionese)

00:04:33.201 --> 00:04:35.136
(laughter)

00:04:36.972 --> 00:04:38.306
(growls)

00:04:38.339 --> 00:04:40.308
AGNES:
(laughs) Gru!
格鲁 我找到独角兽了

00:04:40.341 --> 00:04:42.443
I found a unicorn!
格鲁 我找到独角兽了

00:04:42.477 --> 00:04:44.612
-(humming happily)
-(bleating softly)

00:04:44.645 --> 00:04:46.381
My life is complete!
我的生命完美了

00:04:46.414 --> 00:04:49.184
(Gru sighs)

00:04:49.217 --> 00:04:50.886
Honey, that's...
宝贝儿 其实它并不是真的独角兽

00:04:50.919 --> 00:04:53.554
that's not actually a unicorn.
宝贝儿 其实它并不是真的独角兽

00:04:53.588 --> 00:04:55.690
Huh?

00:04:55.723 --> 00:04:59.327
But-but he has one horn.
但是 它只有一只角啊

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.529
I'm-I'm sorry, sweetie,
我很抱歉 宝贝儿

00:05:01.562 --> 00:05:05.033
but he's just a goat.
但是 它只是只山羊

00:05:05.066 --> 00:05:08.369
Life is just
like that sometimes.
生活有的时候就是这样

00:05:08.403 --> 00:05:12.540
We're hoping for a unicorn,
and we get a goat.
我们希望有只独角兽 却得到了山羊

00:05:14.675 --> 00:05:17.212
Well, you know what?
好吧 你知道吗

00:05:17.245 --> 00:05:21.149
Lucky is the best goat
in the whole wide world!
我的小吉祥是世界上最可爱的山羊

00:05:21.182 --> 00:05:22.483
Look at that face!
你看看它的脸 我忍不住要捏它的脸

00:05:22.517 --> 00:05:25.020
I just want to squeeze it!
你看看它的脸 我忍不住要捏它的脸

00:05:25.053 --> 00:05:27.155
(Agnes grunts)
你看看它的脸 我忍不住要捏它的脸

00:05:27.188 --> 00:05:29.424
Hoo-hoo!
(hums "Physical")

00:05:29.457 --> 00:05:31.592
Whoo! I'll take this.
这个给我吧

00:05:31.626 --> 00:05:34.329
You've been a bad boy, Gru.
你可真是个坏小子 格鲁

00:05:34.362 --> 00:05:36.331
Can you get the rest
of the suitcases?
把剩下的箱子拎过来好吗？

00:05:36.364 --> 00:05:38.533
Come on, girls. Let's go!
走啦 姑娘们 我们走

00:05:38.566 --> 00:05:42.270
* Let's get physical,
physical... *
大家一起动起来 动起来

00:05:42.303 --> 00:05:44.272
(continues humming "Physical")

00:05:44.305 --> 00:05:45.773
(jet whirring softly)

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.012
Change of plans, girls.
计划有变 姑娘们

00:05:51.046 --> 00:05:53.614
(grunting):
Instead of going home--
我们暂时不回家 眉毛

00:05:53.648 --> 00:05:55.416
Eyebrows! Ow!
我们暂时不回家 眉毛

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:58.019
(grunts)
We're going to Hollywood!
先去一趟好莱坞吧

00:05:58.053 --> 00:05:59.054
(laughs maniacally)
先去一趟好莱坞吧

00:05:59.087 --> 00:06:00.421
(girls gasp)

00:06:00.455 --> 00:06:03.024
Now, that's what I call acting.
看到没？这才叫真正的表演

00:06:03.058 --> 00:06:05.093
(chuckles)
Let's go, Clive!
我们走克里夫
大机器人还等着我们呢

00:06:05.126 --> 00:06:06.694
We've got
a giant robot waiting!
我们走克里夫
大机器人还等着我们呢

00:06:06.727 --> 00:06:07.695
(Clive laughs)
我们走克里夫
大机器人还等着我们呢

00:06:07.728 --> 00:06:09.764
(thumping on door)

00:06:09.797 --> 00:06:11.399
Huh?

00:06:11.432 --> 00:06:13.234
(gasps)

00:06:13.268 --> 00:06:15.236
-Lucy?
-(muffled shouting)
露西

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.605
-But...
-Bratt! He took the girls!
-布莱特他劫走了女儿们
-什么？不

00:06:17.638 --> 00:06:20.075
What?! No!
-布莱特他劫走了女儿们
-什么？不

00:06:22.177 --> 00:06:24.612
GRU:
Dru! Dru!
-德鲁
-走开

00:06:24.645 --> 00:06:27.315
Go away!
I don't want to talk to you.
-我不想和你说话
-布莱特劫走了你侄女

00:06:27.348 --> 00:06:29.951
Bratt has the girls!
-我不想和你说话
-布莱特劫走了你侄女

00:06:29.985 --> 00:06:31.352
(gasps)

